<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#foreseesProcurementObject> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation indicating the instance of a Procurement Object that is planned. Additional Information: The properties of the Procurement Object that is foreseen should be read as foreseen properties. For example, Procedure isSMESuitable should be read as Procedure foreseesToBeSMESuitable. For example, Procedure isFundedBy should be read as Procedure foreseesToBeFundedBy."@en .
