<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasZeroEmissionVehicles> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The number of all zero-emission heavy-duty vehicles that have either been purchased, leased, rented, hired-purchased or their use has been contractually committed to for the provision of a purchased service. Additional Information: In the European Union, the legal requirements and scope for the provision of these vehicles or services are covered by Directive 2009/33/EC. (epo:CleanVehicleDirectiveInformation)"@en .
