<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasGrantedExclusiveRightsDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Explanatory text about the applicable right entitling a public service operator to operate certain public passenger transport services on a particular route or network or in a particular area, to the exclusion of any other such operator. (epo:ContractTerm)"@en .
