<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#AgentInRole> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relative concept that ties an Agent to a part they play in a given Situational Context. Additional information: The classification of roles is based is based on the degree of involvement into the Procurement Process: - Primary (Procurement) Pole is directly involved in the Procurement Process; - Secondary (Procurement sub-) Role is secondary to the Procurement Process - Tertiary (Related) Role is not involved in the Procurement Process."@en .
