<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasFollowupContract> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#core> .
<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasMaximumFrameworkAgreementAwardedValue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The maximum value which can be spent through all the framework agreements announced in this notice, including options and renewals of contracts. Additional information: The value provided is a threshold value that implicity means that it cannot be exceeded however it may not be reached during the execution of a contract. The Framework Agreements in a CAN are to be traced back and added to provide this value."@en .
<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasReviewBodyType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation indicating the Review Body Type."@en .
