<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#canProvideNonDiscriminatoryEvidence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relation showing that an Organization can supply an Evidence with regard to the fulfilment of non-discriminatory criteria or the rules applied in order to reduce the number of participants."@en .
<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasAdditionalClassification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#core> .
